    "description": "Warrenkin come from the sprawling goblin-run tunnels that riddle the dungeon's upper levels - warrens of rope bridges, salvaged scrap, and a hundred half-finished traps. Small, quick, and endlessly resourceful, they're raised to solve problems with cunning long before they're strong enough to solve them with force. A Warrenkin who's lived to adulthood has usually out-thought something much bigger than themselves at least once, and remembers exactly how they did it.",
